y request an absentee ballot without providing a reason. Absentee ballot requests must be received by the Division of Elections no later than 10 days before the election. Completed ballots must be postmarked by Election Day and received within 10 days after the election, or returned in person to a polling place or drop site by 8:00 PM on Election Day. Voters may also return ballots by mail, in-person delivery, or authorized representative.", "state_abbreviation": "AK", "voter_registration_url": "https://www.usa.gov/register-to-vote"}	written	\N	state_resources_2026-03-26T03:10:21.844Z	claude:claude-sonnet-4-6	state_resources_enrichment_v1	state_resources_v1	2026-03-25 19:13:27.135986-07	2026-03-25 20:12:57.196987-07	2026-03-25 20:12:57.662042-07	2026-03-25 20:12:57.662042-07
