otherwise eligible. Applications for a mail-in ballot must be received by the early voting clerk no later than the 11th day before Election Day (or the 7th day before Election Day if applying in person). Completed ballots must be received by the close of polls on Election Day if mailed, or by 5 p.m. the day after Election Day if the envelope is postmarked by 7 p.m. on Election Day. Ballots may be returned by mail or delivered in person to the early voting clerk's office.", "state_abbreviation": "TX", "voter_registration_url": "https://www.usa.gov/register-to-vote"}	written	\N	state_resources_2026-03-26T02:43:57.468Z	claude:claude-sonnet-4-6	state_resources_enrichment_v1	state_resources_v1	2026-03-25 19:13:27.178057-07	2026-03-25 19:57:10.039036-07	2026-03-25 19:57:11.488482-07	2026-03-25 19:57:11.488482-07
