 received by the board of canvassers no later than 21 days before the election. Completed ballots must be received by the local board of canvassers by 8:00 PM on Election Day; postmarks alone are not sufficient — the ballot must be physically received by the deadline. Ballots may be returned by mail or delivered in person to the local board of canvassers.", "state_abbreviation": "RI", "voter_registration_url": "https://www.usa.gov/register-to-vote"}	written	\N	state_resources_2026-03-26T02:43:57.468Z	claude:claude-sonnet-4-6	state_resources_enrichment_v1	state_resources_v1	2026-03-25 19:13:27.169487-07	2026-03-25 19:57:09.588823-07	2026-03-25 19:57:11.01475-07	2026-03-25 19:57:11.01475-07
